.\" lp.1 -- maux's stub for the POSIX lp(1) utility, which this tree
.\" does not provide. An original page (this project's own text), so
.\" it carries no third-party notice -- MIT like the code, same
.\" posture as env.1/man.1. Recorded in docs/POSIX-GAPS.md sec 5
.\" ("Not applicable, and why") so the omission is not re-litigated.
.\" Rendered at build time to build/man/LP.TXT and staged on the
.\" play image as /usr/man/LP.
.TH LP 1 "September 17, 2026" maux
.SH NAME
lp \- send files to a printer
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Lp
is not provided on maux.
none of this exists on maux: there is no printer, no mail
transport, and no UUCP.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tip(1)
